      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEZ SO ROYAL (5) has recorded three wins and two minor placings from the past five starts. Was again a dominant force last start when he scored over 2230m at this track, getting home by 8 metres. This is a nice drop in class so he is sure to prove tough to beat again. LE GASTON (7) was out of the money last start when 11 metres from the winner in fifth over 2240m at Melton. Best form reference might be his win at Cranbourne four starts back. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. It doesn't get any easier but on his best form he is capable of sharp improvement. STEAM MACHINE (3) is looking to improve on his last-start eighth behind Luvtobeuptome at Listed level over 2230m at this track two weeks ago. Should enjoy a lovely run and looks hard to beat. OAKLANDER (2) is worth some thought based on his third over 1800m at this track two runs ago.",
